    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Final Checklist for Household Goods and Car Shifting:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Secure all personal items, double‑check cargo restraints, and ensure the vehicle’s registration, insurance, and service records are up to date. This comprehensive approach is what sets an all India car transport company apart, providing peace of mind from pickup to new car delivery.</p>
  </div>
